.Dd November 10, 2026
.Dt THREAD_CREATE 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm thread_create
.Nd create a thread in a process
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Ft Handle
.Fn thread_create "Handle proc" "usize entry" "usize stack_top" "usize arg" "usize flags"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The .Nm system call creates a thread in .Fa proc at .Fa entry with the stack pointer .Fa stack_top.
.Pp
This page documents the native RavenBSD ABI; see the
.Pa raven-abi
crate for the exact numeric value and types.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
On success .Nm returns a non-negative value; on failure it returns a negative error number.
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
